{"2783280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Secretary", "steam_appid": 2783280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the company! Stop the AI takeover! Boop all the office supplies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a stray cat got hired by a multinational entertainment conglomerate obsessed with infinite growth, they had no idea there would be a dark side. It's not all scritches and treats for DOX's first feline employee:  There's a conspiracy to replace the human employees with robots, and the more you unravel the plot, the more you'll get your tiny little paws tangled in the malicious threads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the coffee, fix the router, and earn upgrades to create the corporate reception area of your dreams! Impress your colleagues and they might someday even become your friends....from work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/253b272a7266ea28a49e9d34267edf3e.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/253b272a7266ea28a49e9d34267edf3e.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/253b272a7266ea28a49e9d34267edf3e.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When night rolls around, sneak past the AI security team and stalk the upper floors of DOX HQ! Complete quests to help your coworkers and save the soul of the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/6c8a69b1350aa503b5d4e6279399ee83.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/6c8a69b1350aa503b5d4e6279399ee83.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/6c8a69b1350aa503b5d4e6279399ee83.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DOX lobby has seen better days, but you can spend your hard-earned DOXBux on renovations. Unlock expansions, purchase upgrades, and show off a level of creativity befitting the greatest entertainment conglomerate in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to wear many hats in this new corporate environment. Develop a variety of skills, reveal underhanded schemes, and network with surprising allies as you navigate unconventional corporate trials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your bandwidth and master your core competencies to earn promotions! But be careful! The higher you climb, the more likely we'll have to call the fire department to get you down from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/2db6755db76e453bf4b7f978bec08018.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/2db6755db76e453bf4b7f978bec08018.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/2db6755db76e453bf4b7f978bec08018.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generative AI and unsustainable growth are delivering maximum value to shareholders. But what about the heart and soul of DOX? Can one little cat save a company that has embraced innovation at any cost? Let's circle back on that!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the company! Stop the AI takeover! Boop all the office supplies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a stray cat got hired by a multinational entertainment conglomerate obsessed with infinite growth, they had no idea there would be a dark side. It's not all scritches and treats for DOX's first feline employee:  There's a conspiracy to replace the human employees with robots, and the more you unravel the plot, the more you'll get your tiny little paws tangled in the malicious threads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/c0df72d70a51b37a741bbf557989ef1d.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class