y has seen better days, but you can spend your hard-earned DOXBux on renovations. Unlock expansions, purchase upgrades, and show off a level of creativity befitting the greatest entertainment conglomerate in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/3a11ebd91cdd587911d5647c9ed67317.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to wear many hats in this new corporate environment. Develop a variety of skills, reveal underhanded schemes, and network with surprising allies as you navigate unconventional corporate trials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.poster.avif?t=1788288813\" width=764 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.webm?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783280/extras/d7db193f1438e4e068131a7e120cbc23.mp4?t=1788288813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\